  "title": "Jamaican Rice and Peas",
  "description": "This quick one-pot version of Jamaican rice and peas opts for kidney beans, with a kick from Scotch bonnet peppers and red pepper flakes.",
  "authors": [
    "In the Kitchen with Iesha"
  ],
